SeaBIOS (when built into this directory)
========================================

Upstream project: SeaBIOS
Canonical docs:   https://www.seabios.org/
Source mirror:    https://gitlab.com/qemu-project/seabios.git
Pinned release:   rel-1.16.3 (see ../manifests/seabios.json)

License: GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 or later (LGPL-3.0-or-later).
The full upstream COPYING text is copied beside bios.bin as COPYING.SeaBIOS
when you run ../build-scripts/build-seabios.sh.

x86WASM project policy
----------------------
- Keep SeaBIOS sources and binaries under firmware/ only.
- Do not vendor SeaBIOS (or other LGPL/GPL firmware) sources into MIT/Apache
  Rust crates (firmware-interface, machine-pc, devices, …).
- Do not commit bios.bin until licensing review explicitly allows it
  (*.bin under this tree is gitignored).
- Building SeaBIOS here does not imply SeaBIOS POST is integrated in the
  emulator; ROM mapping helpers may load a blob separately.

See also: docs/licensing.md, docs/adr/0004-firmware-seabios-ovmf.md,
third_party/NOTICE, firmware/README.md.
